#   functions    782/782    100.00%
# Lines and functions are at 100, so their floors are 100: any uncovered line new code adds
# fails CI here. Branches are cut to one decimal (98.9) and rise as the remaining 62 untaken
# arms are covered, to 100.
lines 100
branches 98.9
functions 100
